-- src:6459 | (b) for the purposes of paragraph (a), direct the relevant
-- src:6460 | telecommunication licensee —
-- src:6462 | (i) to establish a separate entity; and
-- src:6464 | (ii) to ensure that the separate entity applies for a licence
